<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-BSkyB rated &quot;sell&quot; at CSFB.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-BSkyB rated &quot;sell&quot; at CSFB.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>CS First Boston said on Monday it had initiated coverage of BSkyB with a &quot;sell&quot; recommendation.</p>
<p>In a research report, CS First Boston said the stock was overvalued, trading at about 21 times 1998 earnings before interest, tax, depreciation and amortization.</p>
<p>Additionally, the brokerage said it was bearish on the prospects for German pay television and general structure of BSkyB's involvement in DF1, in which BSkyB holds a stake.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 542 4027</p>
</text>
